# Live market data uses Yahoo Finance and needs no API key.
#
# Yahoo doesn't set CORS headers, so the client routes requests through:
#   - npm run dev: the Vite dev proxy at /yfproxy/* (configured in vite.config.ts)
#   - production:  https://corsproxy.io/?url=... (free public proxy)
#
# If you want to use your OWN proxy (your Cloudflare Worker, self-hosted
# cors-anywhere, etc.) set the base URL here. It must accept Yahoo's
# /v8/finance/chart/<ticker> path verbatim.
#
# Example: VITE_YAHOO_PROXY=https://your-worker.example.com
VITE_YAHOO_PROXY=
